<ContentLayout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility goals and known validation status for Aurora Website." eyebrow="LEGAL / ACCESSIBILITY" heading="Designed for access." lead="Aurora Website targets WCAG 2.2 AA. A target is not a conformance claim; accessibility requires manual and automated verification.">
<section class="section shell article-content"><h2>Implementation priorities</h2><ul class="content-list"><li>Semantic landmarks, headings and link purposes.</li><li>Keyboard navigation and visible focus states.</li><li>Readable contrast and text scaling.</li><li>Responsive layouts and adequate touch targets.</li><li>Reduced-motion support.</li><li>Accessible names and status text that does not rely on color alone.</li></ul><h2>Validation status</h2><p class="content-copy">A complete WCAG 2.2 AA audit, screen-reader testing and keyboard-only review have not yet been recorded. Report accessibility issues through the <a href="/en/community/feedback/">feedback page</a>.</p></section>
</ContentLayout>